  "details": "Users nameplates in mirror do not correctly reflect the same way you Phyiscally see them compaired to the mirrors copy, The mirror copy follows diffrent Opacity or seems to light a diffrent way compaired to the real nameplate.\n\nApon enabling the world under the mirror layers this issue does disappear, But during raves or partys, The Opacity is still a problem even when in popular worlds.\n\n1: Mirror set to UI+Remote players, no world, Nameplate opacity to 0% (will change)\n\n2: have a friend with their earmuffs on, Tilt the mirror to where you can see both nameplates, Real and mirror variant of it.\n\n3: Play with Opacity slider on the nameplate settings to see effect",
